{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>北京舉行紀念紅軍長征勝利90周年大會。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.CEREMONY-1200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026XYLhmf2dhj1792641393.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>大會早上在人民大會堂舉行，中共總書記、國家主席習近平等中央政治局常委出席，並發表重要講話。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.CEREMONY-1200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20265a4senZwEw1792641413.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>1934年，中央紅軍第五次反圍剿失利，為擺脫敵軍，從江西于都出發，開始戰略轉移，展開二萬五千里長征。至1936年10月，紅軍三大主力在甘肅會寧以及寧夏將台堡勝利會師，標誌長征勝利。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T04:41:00.951909+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T03:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T05:57:59.419511+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T04:37:51.924192+00:00","content_hash":"70501258beaf1a9b72793a070bcfe9a6ef9ed22bd45ece2f23d0778f46520250","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}